                                "sense_id": "655c99eb-90ff-3f10-ac0a-6b4194e3f239",
                                "text": "All these streams of thought—Biblical theology, Reconstructionism, the New Perspective on Paul, Shepherdism, Roman Catholicism, Gaffin and Bavinck, Vantilianism and Neoorthodoxy—- have contributed to the flood of Neolegalism in the churches ."
